e death and  more suffering for both innocent people  and the heroes we then see gigantomachia  tearing through the city which he was  towering over  at the end of chapter 282 and believe me  the destruction is even worse than what  you're imagining right now  i don't think hero society can ever be  the same after this moment  like this is 10 times worse than kamino  we see people on the ground running away  but it's totally pointless  as chunks of buildings and cars just  come hurtling towards them  machia roars loudly and according to the  spoilers he thinks to himself  that he feels like he's coming to life  if that translation is accurate then oh  boy  all we know is that whatever that  sedative was it activates the more  machia moves around momo said it herself  so you know he's moving around quite a  bit right now he's destroying entire  cities  and yet instead of feeling sleepy he  feels like he's coming to life  what does that mean what was this stuff  i will admit that momo's internal  dialogue it always seems to indicate  that she's on the side of the heroes  you know she never thinks any villainous  thoughts or anything like that  but it's just getting very suspicious  now we need answers  we need answers at this moment the  league of villains are still just  chilling on makia's back  as dabi smiles happily at all the  destruction they're now super close to  shigaraki  and we know this because dr garaki is  able to hear machias raw  and said that makio was engineered to  die for his master  in his words the nomu are simply  imitations of gigantomachia  and his willingness to do anything for  sugaraki the scene then pans to the  nearly higher nomus  still fighting many of the heroes which  is something we hadn't seen for many  many chapters and i was starting to  wonder  if they'd been defeated or something but  no they are still fighting the heroes  the manga then switches to the main  battlefield where shoto had just arrived  in the last chapter  he uses his eyes to slide past endeavour  and apologizes for being late to help  telling his father that he can now you  know take some time to cool down  and avoid overheating in previous  chapters we saw how endeavour used the  vanishing fist  as well as a bunch of other attacks on  shiguraki and yeah by this point he was  getting a lot  lot weaker even gran torino said it so  he does need to take a break of some  kind  meanwhile deku bravely blasts off  straight towards shigaraki  as both bakago and roklot shout out that  this is a terrible idea  telling him to get away midoriya's face  is filled with rage  as tears are just streaming down his  cheeks and he replies to rock clocks  saying that he doesn't want to run away  i honestly cannot believe there are  people out there who just disrespect  deku like  how can you tell me this guy isn't one  of the most fearless main characters  around  ashigaraki goes to say something he's  unable to complete his sentence because  a massive gash just appears on the right  side of his body  with blood squirting out from both his  chest and his shoulder  just looking at this panel myself it'll  almost look like his right arm is about  to fall off  shiggy yells out in horror as he looks  down at his own body  saying to himself that he understands  his body wasn't yet complete  and that he's been moving above his  physical limitations  deku thinks to himself that shiguraki's  hyper regeneration  is probably about to start working and  ponders the fact that you know  he also has multiple quirks inside one  for all he considers that gran torino  doesn't have much time left to live  and has flashbacks to his past failures  when trying to master the quirk  the translation says that deku  regretfully realizes and accepts  that he's not yet ready to use it all at  this time  which i think is referring to you know  the different multiple quirks i think  it's important to remember that deku  already knows what most of the quirks  he's going to get  are because all might gave him this book  that kind of detailed pretty much all  the quirks  except for these second and third users  the scene then shifts again  and this time it's a flashback to mirko  attacking shigaraki's container  at which point he was at 75 completion  we then see a random hero holding an  injured mirko  telling her to go to sleep according to  the translation though  mirko replies by saying you win if you  live  which again i think this is just her way  of saying that she needs to remain  conscious right now  but yeah sometimes it's hard to tell  what these uh rough translations  actually mean  regardless this is a major death flag  for mirko as the next panel cuts back to  shigaraki  who uses the two fingers on his left  hand to hold his damaged right arm in  place  he then crouches down to the ground and  yells out if you touch it it's over  he makes contact with the ground and  just a wave of decay springs into action  heading straight for the heroes however  in one of the most  iconic moments the series has ever seen  deku leaps into the sky  and uses black whip to pull everyone  into the air and avoid the destruction  this includes endeavour rock clock  bakago shoto literally everyone  and he finally for the first time  activates his  third quirk which is called float this  previously belonged to nana shimura who  was the seventh user of one for all  and it's the perfect counter to  shigaraki's decay quirk because  it allows him to float in the air like  it says rock clock is super confused at  this moment  and he's like floating like what is  going on i can empathize  with him a lot because if i didn't know  about one for all i'd be pretty damn  confused myself as to how this one kid  uses all these vastly different powers  like what does it look like he has a  black whip quirk he has some sort of  superpower quirk and now he's floating  in the air like  yeah that's pretty crazy we then see  gran torino who is somehow still  breathing  and he smiles fondly whilst remembering  his time  flying next to nana shimura back in the  day deku then pulls up in front of  shigaraki  and uses his new power to float in the  air and says  in the air i will stop you i'll do  everything i can  and with that the chapter ends and what  an ending it was  while this is the first time we've seen  deku use float i do wonder if it's the  very first time he's actually used it i  mean oh my did say a while ago that  float would be the next quirk deku  unlocks so maybe he has some experience  with it that we've just not seen  um it would definitely be a bonus you  know coming up against shigeraki  it would be good to have a little bit of  experience to know what you're doing  anyway there is no new chapter next week  uh the manga is on hiatus  for one week only so in two weeks we  will get chapter 284  and remember to smash that subscribe  button if you haven't already  and until the next one peace out
 

